  "prefLabel": "Plc 1202.02 Court reporter",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1202.02 “Court reporter” means “court reporter” as defined in RSA 310-A:162, II, namely “a person who has met the requirements set forth in this subdivision and is licensed to engage in shorthand reporting or voice writing.” For purposes of this definition, “this subdivision” means RSA 310-A:161-181.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1200.html"
